            "content": "<div class=\"mb-10\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0561/2742/2636/files/faqs.jpg?v=1620784288\"></div>\n<h3 class=\"font-medium text-xl mb-4\">Awkwardness gives me great comfort. I’ve never been cool, but I’ve felt cool. I’ve been in the cool place, but I wasn’t really cool – I was trying to pass for hip or cool.</h3>\n<p>A girl should be two things: classy and fabulous. I am convinced that there can be luxury in simplicity. I wanted to dress the woman who lives and works, not the woman in a painting. It’s hard to balance everything. It’s always challenging. My relationships with producers or photographers – these are relationships that took years. I can’t get sucked into that celebrity thing, because I think it’s just crass. My aim is to make the poor look rich.</p>"
